<title>FRANCE: M6 TELEVISION H1 97 UP 12.8 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>M6 TELEVISION H1 97 UP 12.8 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover			     1,472.0 vs   1,157.9</p>
<p>	- advertising		    1,078.5 vs     999.1</p>
<p>NOTE: The company gave the figures in the official Balo bulletin. It said sales rose 12.8 percent on a like for like basis.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
